  "code": "INELIG",
  "loc": "Abstract; Sections 2-5, pp. 397-416",
  "quote": "characterizes the Shapley value (the Shapley\u2013Shubik power index) on the domain of TU (simple) games",
  "note": "The main object is the axiomatic characterization of cooperative-game values (Shapley value, weighted Shapley values) and a power index for simple games. It does not aggregate agents' submitted inputs into a collective decision by voting. Simple games are used only as a mathematical domain for a priori power measurement. Not eligible; coding stopped."
